<section id="main" style="position:relative; padding:164px 0 70px; background:var(--black); overflow:hidden;">
  <div class="photo" role="img" aria-label="Young athletes and coaches at The Courts" style="position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:0.32;"></div>
  <div class="container" style="position:relative; z-index:2; max-width:760px;">
    <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Our Story</span>
    <h1 class="page-hero-title" style="margin-top:14px;">Hello, <span class="accent" style="position:relative; display:inline-block;"><span class="about-hero-badge" style="position:absolute; bottom:100%; right:0; margin-bottom:20px; display:inline-block; background:var(--orange); color:var(--white); font-family:var(--font-sport); font-size:15px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:10px 24px; border-radius:999px; white-space:nowrap;">Opening October 1</span>Nolensville.</span></h1>
    <style>@media (max-width: 640px) { .about-hero-badge { font-size:12px; padding:8px 16px; margin-bottom:10px; } }</style>
    <p class="page-hero-sub" style="margin-top:22px; font-weight:600; color:var(--white); font-size:19px;">We open October 1. Shoes tied. Let's go.</p>
    <p class="page-hero-sub" style="margin-top:14px;">The Courts is built around what we think makes sports great: good coaches, athletes who want to work, teammates who make each other better,<br>and people who show up for one another. <span style="white-space:nowrap; display:block; padding-top:10px;">That's the kind of community we want on our courts.</span></p>
    <p class="page-hero-sub" style="margin-top:26px;"><em>See you on the court.</em><br><span style="color:var(--white); font-weight:600; display:inline-block; margin-top:12px;">Melissa Carle</span><br><span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size:14px;">Founder, The Courts</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how-we-play" style="padding:70px 0; background:var(--gray-light);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How We Play</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Serious About Development.<br>Not Everything Else.</h2>
      <p class="section-sub">We care about good coaching, meaningful reps, and learning how to compete without making every Tuesday feel like Game 7.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto-item reveal">
      <h3>Do the Work.</h3>
      <p style="line-height:1.8; font-size:17px;">No magic drill. No shortcut.<br><strong>Show up. Put in the reps.</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto-photo-strip photo" role="img" aria-label="Sweat on an athlete's neck and shoulder after training" style="aspect-ratio:4/3; max-width:420px; margin:16px auto 36px;">
      <img src="images/sweat-detail.jpg" alt="">
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto-item manifesto-item--right reveal">
      <h3>Be Coachable.</h3>
      <p style="line-height:1.8; font-size:17px;">Listen. Ask questions. Try it differently.<br><strong>Nobody has it all figured out.</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto-photo-strip photo" role="img" aria-label="Two young athletes sitting on the hardwood, listening as a coach talks to the group" style="aspect-ratio:3/4; max-width:420px; margin:16px auto 36px;">
      <img src="images/team-listening.jpg" alt="">
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto-item reveal">
      <h3>Compete Well.</h3>
      <p style="line-height:1.8; font-size:17px;">Play hard. Want to win.<br><strong>Know how to handle it either way.</strong></p>
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto-item manifesto-item--right reveal">
      <h3>Be a Great Teammate.</h3>
      <p style="line-height:1.8; font-size:17px;">Bring energy. Pick people up.<br><strong>Make the gym better when you're in it.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

